  "description": "DILHIS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C32 H52 F24 O34 S8 Sm4,C4 H8 O1. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.497-4.110 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.33-133.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Sm4(μ3-O)2(μ2-OTf)6(μ3-OTf)2(THF)4(dme)2]·THF. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
